itium","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LightNucleus.tritium","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LightNucleus.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LightNucleus.deuterium","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LightNucleus.deuterium","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LightNucleus.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LightNucleus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LightNucleus","kind":"inductive","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LightNucleus.lean#L19-L26","doc":"**Light-nucleus enumeration** for the canonical knot\nidentification: deuteron (²H = 6_2), tritium (³H = 8_11),\nhelium-3 (³He = L_6a4). ","signatureChunk":0}]}